DIAMOND TD MACRO - UPDATE LOG
=============================

v1.0 - Initial State
- Base macro with TDS mode, custom mode, hybrid mode
- Image detection for Restart, Ready, Play Again
- Pixel/veto detection
- Recovery/rejoin behavior
- FPS tools, statistics, profiles, templates
- Dependency setup, EXE builder
- Diamond branding

v1.1 - Statistics Fix
- Fixed statistics counter: failed runs no longer count coins/XP
- Only successful runs add to totals
- Separates wins from losses properly

v1.2 - Performance Profiler
- Added performance profiler
- Tracks timing for each operation
- Generates report at end of session
- Shows which operations are slowest
- Setting: performance_profiler

v1.3 - Multi-Profile Hot Swapping
- Added F11 to swap to profile 1
- Added F12 to swap to profile 2
- Instant profile switching mid-game
- Settings: hot_swap_profiles, hot_swap_profile_1, hot_swap_profile_2

v1.4 - Wave Prediction System
- Added basic wave prediction based on time
- Estimates current wave number
- Setting: wave_prediction

v1.5 - Auto-Economy Management
- Tracks coin income rate
- Suggests tower sales if rate is low
- Setting: auto_economy

v1.6 - Tower Placement Suggestions
- Framework for map-based suggestions
- Database integration ready
- Setting: tower_suggestions

v1.7 - Discord Notifications
- Sends session reports to Discord
- Optional screenshots
- Webhook-based
- Settings: discord_notifications, discord_webhook, discord_screenshots
- Dependency: requests

v1.8 - Map Database
- Save/load strategies per map
- JSON-based storage
- Setting: map_database

v1.9 - Gemini 2.5 Flash AI Advisor
- Runs after each match completes
- Sends stats to Gemini
- Gets 3 improvement suggestions
- Saves suggestions to file
- Settings: gemini_advisor, gemini_api_key
- Dependency: google-generativeai

v1.10 - Tesseract Auto-Install
- Automatically downloads and installs Tesseract OCR
- No manual installation needed
- Required for upgrade adaptation system

v1.11 - Automated Upgrade Adaptation System
- Full tower upgrade system
- OCR-based level reading (Lv. 0-7)
- Prioritizes Level 1 first, then Level 2, etc.
- 0.2s cycle time per tower
- 15-pixel search pattern to find tower UI
- Green/gray pixel detection for upgrade availability
- Settings: auto_upgrade_system, max_upgrade_level, upgrade_pixel_green, upgrade_pixel_gray, upgrade_pixel_x, upgrade_pixel_y, tower_search_radius, upgrade_cycle_time
- Images: your_tower.png, lv_0.png through lv_7.png, upgrade_green.png, upgrade_gray.png

v1.12 - Adaptive Lag Compensation
- Measures ping to Roblox servers every 60 seconds
- Automatically adjusts ALL timings based on latency
- 50ms = 1.0x, 100ms = 2.0x multiplier (capped at 4.0x)
- Settings: lag_compensation, lag_multiplier

v1.13 - Visual Strategy Overlay
- Expanded Mahoraga overlay to show tower spots, enemy paths, next moves
- Functions: add_tower_spot(), set_enemy_path(), set_next_move(), show_strategy()
- Settings: strategy_overlay, overlay_tower_spots, overlay_paths, overlay_next_move

v1.14 - Voice Control
- Windows Speech Recognition integration
- Commands: "start macro", "stop macro", "skip run" (customizable)
- Settings: voice_control, voice_start, voice_stop, voice_skip
- Dependencies: SpeechRecognition, PyAudio

v1.15 - Anti-Detection Humanizer
- Random delay variation on all sleeps
- Random mouse jitter on clicks
- Random click timing variation
- Settings: humanizer, humanizer_delay_range, humanizer_mouse_jitter, humanizer_click_variation

v1.16 - Replay Heatmap Generator
- Tracks all clicks and tower placements
- Generates visual heatmap image at end of session
- Shows click positions (green dots) and tower spots (blue circles)
- Settings: heatmap_enabled, heatmap_show_clicks, heatmap_show_towers

v1.17 - Profit Calculator
- Calculates electricity cost based on PC power usage
- Calculates profit/hour from game coins
- Tracks ROI and saves profit history
- Settings: profit_calculator, electricity_cost_kwh, pc_power_watts, coin_value_usd

v1.18 - Auto-Screencast Recorder
- Records highlight clips on wins and high scores
- Saves as MP4 videos
- Settings: screencast_recorder, screencast_on_win, screencast_on_high_score, screencast_threshold_coins, screencast_duration

v1.19 - Account Health Monitor
- Tracks "human-like" score based on play patterns
- Auto-cooldown when score drops below threshold
- Prevents 24/7 botting
- Settings: account_health_monitor, health_cooldown_minutes, health_warning_threshold

v1.20 - Real-Time Strategy Switcher
- Automatically switches to backup profile after X consecutive failures
- Detects when current strategy isn't working
- Settings: strategy_switcher, strategy_fail_threshold, backup_profile

v1.21 - Cloud Profile Marketplace (GitHub Gist)
- Upload profiles to GitHub Gist
- Download profiles from Gist URLs
- Share strategies with community
- Settings: cloud_profiles, github_token
