v1.22 - Ability Spam System
- Automatically spams tower abilities
- Configurable interval
- Background thread
- Setting: ability_spam, ability_spam_interval

v1.23 - Hotbar Click Selection
- Select slots by clicking instead of keys
- Scaled coordinates
- Setting: hotbar_click_select

v1.24 - Tower UI Caching
- Caches menu position for faster access
- 30-second cache validity
